{
  "id": "829",
  "title": "Are You Going?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-10-31",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming’s classmate is having a birthday party. Who is going?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/829/9867896490dfafdccee2c175878c4db67922c3da.mp3?1572261035",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你去吗？\n\n小明妈：小明同学笑笑的生日会，你去吗？\n小明爸：我去。你呢？\n小明妈：我也去。\n小明爸：我们都去，不太好吧？\n小明妈：我去也行，不去也行。那我不去了，你去吧！\n小明爸：你不去，我也不想去了。\n小明妈：你到底想怎么样？\n小明爸：那我们都不去？\n小明妈：我们都不去，小明一个人去不太好吧？你在家吧，我去。",
    "traditional": "你去嗎？\n\n小明媽：小明同學笑笑的生日會，你去嗎？\n小明爸：我去。你呢？\n小明媽：我也去。\n小明爸：我們都去，不太好吧？\n小明媽：我去也行，不去也行。那我不去了，你去吧！\n小明爸：你不去，我也不想去了。\n小明媽：你到底想怎麼樣？\n小明爸：那我們都不去？\n小明媽：我們都不去，小明一個人去不太好吧？你在家吧，我去。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are you going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明妈：小明同学笑笑的生日会，你去吗？",
      "traditional": "小明媽：小明同學笑笑的生日會，你去嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā xiǎo míng tóng xué xiào xiào de shēng rì huì nǐ qù ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: Are you going to Little Ming’s classmate Xiao Xiao’s birthday party?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明爸：我去。你呢？",
      "traditional": "小明爸：我去。你呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà wǒ qù nǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: I’m going. How about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明妈：我也去。",
      "traditional": "小明媽：我也去。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā wǒ yě qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: I’m going too."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明爸：我们都去，不太好吧？",
      "traditional": "小明爸：我們都去，不太好吧？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà wǒ men dōu qù bú tài hǎo ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: It’s not so good that both of us are going, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明妈：我去也行，不去也行。那我不去了，你去吧！",
      "traditional": "小明媽：我去也行，不去也行。那我不去了，你去吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā wǒ qù yě xíng bú qù yě xíng nà wǒ bú qù le nǐ qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: I’m ok with both going and not going. Then I’m not going, so you go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明爸：你不去，我也不想去了。",
      "traditional": "小明爸：你不去，我也不想去了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà nǐ bú qù wǒ yě bù xiǎng qù le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: If you’re not going, then I don’t want to go either."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明妈：你到底想怎么样？",
      "traditional": "小明媽：你到底想怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā nǐ dào dǐ xiǎng zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: What do you want after all?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小明爸：那我们都不去？",
      "traditional": "小明爸：那我們都不去？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà nà wǒ men dōu bú qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: So none of us are going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小明妈：我们都不去，小明一个人去不太好吧？",
      "traditional": "小明媽：我們都不去，小明一個人去不太好吧？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā wǒ men dōu bú qù xiǎo míng yí ge rén qù bú tài hǎo ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "你在家吧，我去。",
      "traditional": "你在家吧，我去。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zài jiā ba wǒ qù",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: If neither of us go, it wouldn’t be so good if Little Ming went by himself, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You stay at home, and I’ll go."
    }
  ],
